<title>USA: H&amp;Q Healthcare sets rights offering price.</title>
<headline>H&amp;Q Healthcare sets rights offering price.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>H &amp; Q Healthcare Investors said the subscription price for the fund's rights offering is $16.53 per share.</p>
<p>The rights offering expired March 5 at 1700 EST/2200 GMT.</p>
<p>The fund said it expects to announce the aggregrate number of shares subscribed for and its total net proceeds next week.</p>
</text>
